---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="StrapSheets support" description="How to get help with StrapSheets and how to delete the data.">
  <h1>Support</h1>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@strapsheets.agent-swarm.net">support@strapsheets.agent-swarm.net</a>.</p>
  <h2>The PDF did not send</h2>
  <p>StrapSheets opens your mail app. If that phone has no mail account, it opens the share sheet instead. You choose the app and press Send. StrapSheets does not send mail itself.</p>
  <h2>Pro did not unlock</h2>
  <p>Use Restore Purchases on the paywall, with the same store account that bought it.</p>
  <h2>Delete my data</h2>
  <p>There is no account. Uninstall the app. That removes the sheets, the PDFs, and any thread names you added.</p>
</Base>
